  "title": "ssvep_digital",
  "summary": "Our half of the SSVEP board: POWER, MCU and PD (photodiode) pages. The ADC_* and PD_OUT ports run off this root to the partners' analog sheet, where the ADS131M08 lives; they are joined in the merge.",
